369
00:34:52.470 --> 00:34:54.556
What is it? Do you want to play?

370
00:35:05.400 --> 00:35:06.443
What the...

371
00:35:33.345 --> 00:35:35.472
You must not be from around here.
That's enough.

372
00:35:35.555 --> 00:35:36.723
